.*******   *FUNCTION     : REPLACEMENT FOR DUMMY SGIDSP03        MVS38J 01700038
.*******   *               IN MVS 3.8 TO SUPPORT 3380 SYSGENS    MVS38J 01800038
.*******   *LIBRARY      : AGENLIB                               MVS38J 01900038
.*******   *DEPENDENCIES : GLOBAL SYSGEN VARIABLES (SGGBLPAK)    MVS38J 02000038
.*******   *               OLD SYSGEN DIT GEN      (SGDITGBL)    MVS38J 02100038
.*******   *PARAMETERS   : UNIT   = DEVICE TYPE                  MVS38J 02200038
