         LCLC  &NUCM                       +NUCLEUS MODULES      MVS38J 02400038
         COPY  SGGBLPAK                    +GET GLOBAL VARS      MVS38J 02500038
         AIF   ('&UNIT' EQ '3380').G3380   +GEN 3380 CALL??      MVS38J 02600038
         AGO   .EXIT001                    +  NEITHER - GET OUT  MVS38J 02700038
